<Layout
	title="About Vortex & Vector"
	description="A weekly dispatch on robotics and mechatronics, written by Ishtiak Alam Rafid."
	pubDate={new Date('2026-08-27')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		<strong>Vortex &amp; Vector</strong> is a weekly newsletter and blog about robotics and
		mechatronics — the mechanisms, the control systems, the competitions, and the ideas borrowed
		from biology that make machines move.
	</p>

	<p>
		Each issue digs into one corner of the field: a build log from a real project, a teardown of
		how something actually works under the hood, a look at what's happening in robotics
		competitions, or a dispatch from the researchers pulling inspiration from nature.
	</p>

	<p>
		It's written and maintained by <strong>Ishtiak Alam Rafid</strong>, based in Dhaka, Bangladesh.
	</p>

	<p>
		Have a project, a correction, or a topic you want covered? Reach out via the GitHub link in the
		header — issues and pull requests are welcome.
	</p>
</Layout>
